tv: Good Morining
tv: We interupt your morning shows to bring you some shocking news, Mina, age 19, is currently being detained at the Summer Valley Jail
tv: She is being charged with the murder of 2 individuals

tv: The first victim has been identified as Jose, age 19, A college student and waiter at the Summer Valley Cafe
tv: Also identified as her unrequited love

tv: The second victim has been identified as Ruby, age 19, A Computer Science major at the Summer Valley University
tv: She has been identified as Jose's girlfriend

tv: Officer Jan Kirchoff has stated that the murders seem to have been caused by what seems like obsessive love
tv: Mina is currently being questioned by Professor Tengen Ruise, A renowned psychologist and therapist brought in to examine this case

tv: Hopefully more information on this case will be disclosed to the public
tv: Stay safe, folks
tv: You may never know...
tv: You might be the next victim of a case similar to this
tv: That's all for today. Thank you for watching

Tv turns off
Silence fills the room
Only the hums of the flourescent lights can be heard
You look down at your hands, all you can see is blood
And below that, your arms, bounded together by handcuffs

You slowly begin to realise what you have done, your stomach hurts, but that pain...
Is nothing compared to the screams from behind the metal door
The screams of Mina's mother, asking you why you would do such a thing to her

voice: Why?, Why would you do such a thing?, Why?......

Her screams fill your heart with guilt and you begin to cry, not because you are sorry but because you knew she was right.....
You were the one who did it and you would even do it again
Suddenly a loud voice emerged from the other side of the room

detective: Can ya keep ya voice levels down
detective: I'm tryna think here

You look at him, A pale old man with a beard the size of a small bush
He takes a cup of coffee and begins to sip violently, He then takes one big breath and say's...

detective: Now that you're done making noise let's get straight into it

mina: I have nothing to say

detective: Why don't we start from the very beginning , What do you say?

mina: I dont want to talk about it

detective: That's fine, But you're going to be here for a long time and I have nothing else to do

He begins to look at me, He's eyes are calm and patient simply waiting.....
And you realise he is right, You want someone to know, You want someone who can truly understand you, And he is the only person who is willing to hear you out
